[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340432232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122575#issuecomment-5340432232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122575","id":5340432232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPlCHaA","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T09:50:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T09:50:34Z","body":"Looks much more sensible (and race condition proof) to me to use an explicit reference here (as you have done via Variant).\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell the `(void)source;` shouldn't afaik be \"necessary\", but can suppress compiler warnings for unused variable, and protect against a later dev changing the scope here. (did you get any problems from not using it?)\r\n\r\nThere is also `[[maybe_unused]]` in c++17 for warnings but that is a matter of taste imo.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340432232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340553723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122575#issuecomment-5340553723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122575","id":5340553723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPlJh-w","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T10:02:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T10:09:15Z","body":"No, currently it is always being used (even if we don't need it, after this PR it will also serve the role of keeping `this` alive). Just a reminder to keep it scoped to the end of the function.\r\n\r\nAfter https://redirect.github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453 the original `Ref<RefCounted> rc` that was used in a similar place was placed inside the scope, thus the description from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109770 \r\n> The Ref ended up scoped in a way that it wouldn't live up to the end of the function, therefore rendered useless.\r\n\r\nSo it is here as a remainder.\r\n\r\nI just noticed that `source` that is already here also keeps it alive, but it uses ref init, despite the long comment about how ref init should be avoided. After some tests I wrote in the description when ref init should be avoided with `emit_signalp` with a question.\r\n\r\nThe `source` original purpose is to pass `this` to the callable when the signal is connected with `CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT` flag.\r\n\r\nSo, maybe the name should be `source_and_keep_alive`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340553723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340634033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122575#issuecomment-5340634033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122575","id":5340634033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPlObsQ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T10:10:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T10:11:15Z","body":"> So, maybe the name should be source_and_keep_alive?\r\n\r\nAh I didn't spot that `source` was already being used (github hiding non-changing code). In that case it's probably fine now you've added the comments indicating the lifetime of refcounted objects should stay valid to the end of the function.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340634033/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5345628352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122575#issuecomment-5345628352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122575","id":5345628352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPp_QwA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:38Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:38Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5345628352/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]